#[doc = " @brief Defines the align rules of child component in Stack container, which can be set, reset, and obtained as required through APIs.\n The default value is <b>ARKUI_LOCALIZED_ALIGNMENT_CENTER</b>.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: LocalizedAlignment mode. The data type is {@link ArkUI_LocalizedAlignment}.</li>\n </ul>\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: LocalizedAlignment mode. The data type is {@link ArkUI_LocalizedAlignment}.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Layout\n @since 23\n"]
