#[doc = " @brief Defines the step of the slider. This attribute can be set, reset, and obtained as required through APIs.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\\n\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].f32: step. The value range is [0.01, 100].</li> \\n\n </ul>\n \\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\\n\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].f32: step. The value range is [0.01, 100].</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Slider"]
