#[doc = " @brief Sets whether dragging scrolling with the left mouse button pressed is supported.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: whether dragging scrolling with the left mouse button pressed is supported. <b>0</b>: no;\n <b>1</b>: yes. Default value: <b>0</b>.</li>\n </ul>\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: whether dragging scrolling with the left mouse button pressed is supported. <b>0</b>: no;\n <b>1</b>: yes.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Scrollable Container Component\n @since 26.0.0"]
