#[doc = " @brief Defines the scroll snap animation speed for the <b>List</b> component.\n This attribute can be set, reset, and obtained as required through APIs.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: scroll snap animation speed for the <b>List</b> component. The parameter type is\n {@link ArkUI_ScrollSnapAnimationSpeed}. Default value: <b>ARKUI_SCROLL_SNAP_ANIMATION_NORMAL</b>.</li>\n </ul>\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: scroll snap animation speed for the <b>List</b> component. The parameter type is\n {@link ArkUI_ScrollSnapAnimationSpeed}.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Scrollable Container Component\n @since 22"]
