#[doc = " @brief Defines the style of the divider for the list items. This attribute can be set, reset, and obtained\n as required through APIs.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].u32: color of the divider, in 0xARGB format.</li>\n <li>.value[1].f32: stroke width of the divider, in vp.</li>\n <li>.value[2].f32: distance between the divider and the start of the list, in vp.</li>\n <li>.value[3].f32: distance between the divider and the end of the list, in vp.</li>\n </ul>\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].u32: color of the divider, in 0xARGB format.</li>\n <li>.value[1].f32: stroke width of the divider, in vp.</li>\n <li>.value[2].f32: distance between the divider and the start of the list, in vp.</li>\n <li>.value[3].f32: distance between the divider and the end of the list, in vp.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Scrollable Container Component"]
pub const ArkUI_NodeAttributeType_NODE_LIST_ITEM_GROUP_SET_DIVIDER: ArkUI_NodeAttributeType =
    1005002;
