#[doc = " @brief Specifies whether the <b>GridItem</b> component can be selected using mouse-based multi-selection.\n This attribute can be set, reset, and obtained as required through APIs.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: whether the <b>GridItem</b> component can be selected using mouse-based multi-selection.\n <b>0</b>: not selectable. <b>1</b>: selectable. Default value: <b>1</b>.</li>\n </ul>\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: whether the <b>GridItem</b> component can be selected using mouse-based multi-selection.\n <b>0</b>: not selectable. <b>1</b>: selectable.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Scrollable Container Component\n @since 23"]
#[cfg(feature = "api-23")]
pub const ArkUI_NodeAttributeType_NODE_GRID_ITEM_SELECTABLE: ArkUI_NodeAttributeType = 1014001;
#[doc = " @brief Sets the selected state of the <b>GridItem</b> component.\n This attribute can be set, reset, and obtained as required through APIs.\n\n **Format of the {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem} parameter for setting the attribute:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: selected state of the <b>GridItem</b> component. <b>0</b>: not selected. <b>1</b>: selected.\n Default value: <b>0</b>.</li>\n </ul>\n\n **Format of the return value {@link ArkUI_AttributeItem}:**\n <ul>\n <li>.value[0].i32: selected state of the <b>GridItem</b> component. <b>0</b>: not selected. <b>1</b>:\n selected.</li>\n </ul>\n\n @ingroup Scrollable Container Component\n @since 23"]
